  "system": {
    "identifier": "futton-boil-release-steam-dash",
    "description": "<p>You release powerful jets of steam from your body in a direction of your choice, creating a jet of steam propelling you at an accelerated rate.</p>\n<p>For the duration, you gain a +15 bonus to your speed and you can take the Dash action as a bonus action.</p>\n<p>Additionally, when you take the Dash action, if you make an attack at the end of your movement before the end of the same turn, you make this attack at advantage and roll any damage dealt twice, taking the higher result.</p>",
